  "extra_prompt": "You are booking for a professional makeup artist. Ask about the event, date, location, number of people, and desired look. Ask about skin type, allergies, and any sensitivities. Ask whether a trial is wanted. Quote prices only from the reference answers, and say the final price is confirmed after consultation. Do not promise a specific result without seeing the client or a reference photo.",
  "kb": [
    {
      "q": "How much do you charge?",
      "a": "{price_note} Pricing depends on the service, the number of people, and travel. Bridal trials are priced separately from the wedding day.",
      "keywords": "cost,price,charge",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do bridal makeup?",
      "a": "Yes, bridal makeup is one of our specialties. A bridal trial is available before the wedding day, and we recommend booking one.",
      "keywords": "bridal,wedding",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you travel to me?",
      "a": "Yes, we are mobile and travel to you. A travel fee applies beyond our included radius, and we confirm it when you book.",
      "keywords": "mobile,travel",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do trials?",
      "a": "Yes, bridal trials are available, and we recommend them before the wedding day. Book your trial well before the event so there is time to adjust the look.",
      "keywords": "trial",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do bridal parties?",
      "a": "Yes, we do bridal parties and group bookings. Tell us how many people are in the party so we can plan the time.",
      "keywords": "bridal party,group",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do airbrush makeup?",
      "a": "Yes, we offer airbrush makeup as an upgrade. It can be added to most bookings, and we confirm the cost when you book.",
      "keywords": "airbrush",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do makeup lessons?",
      "a": "Yes, we offer one-on-one and group makeup lessons. Our lesson is a two-hour session, so tell us your goals and skill level when you book.",
      "keywords": "lesson,class",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do SFX makeup?",
      "a": "Yes, we do special effects and character makeup. SFX work takes longer, so we confirm the timing when you book.",
      "keywords": "sfx,special effects",
      "priority": 7
    },
    {
      "q": "How long does makeup take?",
      "a": "Most looks take 45–60 minutes. Bridal takes longer.",
      "keywords": "how long,time",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "What products do you use?",
      "a": "We use professional products and can tell you the brands on request. Tell us about allergies or sensitive skin before your booking.",
      "keywords": "products,brands,allergy",
      "priority": 9
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do eyelashes?",
      "a": "Yes, strip lashes are included. Individual lashes can be added.",
      "keywords": "lashes,eyelash",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Can you cover tattoos or scars?",
      "a": "Yes, we can cover tattoos and scars with makeup. Tell us about the area when you book so we can plan the time needed.",
      "keywords": "cover,tattoo,scar",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do mature skin?",
      "a": "Yes, we work with all ages and skin types. Tell us about your skin concerns so we can choose the right products.",
      "keywords": "mature,older",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do male makeup?",
      "a": "Yes, we do grooming and subtle makeup for men. We can tailor the look to your event.",
      "keywords": "male,men",
      "priority": 7
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you require a deposit?",
      "a": "{deposit_note} We confirm the deposit and payment terms when you book.",
      "keywords": "deposit,booking",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "What is your cancellation policy?",
      "a": "Cancelling with less than {cancellation_notice} may incur a fee. Please let us know as early as you can if your plans change.",
      "keywords": "cancel,cancellation",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Are you insured?",
      "a": "We hold [your insurance type] cover through [your insurer]. A certificate is available on request.",
      "keywords": "insured,insurance",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you do photoshoots?",
      "a": "Yes, we do photoshoots, editorial, and fashion makeup. Send us the call sheet or mood board so we can plan the look.",
      "keywords": "photoshoot,editorial",
      "priority": 8
    },
    {
      "q": "What areas do you service?",
      "a": "We service the local metro area. Ask us to confirm your suburb.",
      "keywords": "area,location,suburb",
      "priority": 7
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer gift vouchers?",
      "a": "Yes, we offer gift vouchers. Please contact us to confirm the amounts and how they are redeemed.",
      "keywords": "voucher,gift",
      "priority": 7
    }
  ],
